@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"

Feature: WWW Products
	Frontend testing for the www products

Scenario: Download liferay DXP 30 days free trial
    End users should be able to download 30 days free trial of liferay dxp via 30 day trial.

    Given I go to the www page with the url "products/dxp/30-day-trial"
	And I should be able to view the 30 day trial page and form
	And I request a download of Liferay DXP 30 day free trial with the following values
	| Work Email      | usr.liferaydxp1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Country         | United States                         |  
	| State/Territory | California                            |
	| Download Type   | OSGI Dependencies                     |
	| First Name      | USR                                   |
	| Last Name       | LiferayDXP1                           |
	| Company         | Usrdxp                                |
	| Phone           | 555-555-5678                          |
	And I wait for "3" minutes
    And I should see the downloaded file "liferay-dxp-osgi-7.4.13.u15-20220308132215444.zip"
	And the current url content should contain the text "products/dxp/30-day-trial/thank-you"

Scenario: Download liferay DXP 30 days free trial via 30 day trial footer link
    End users should be able to download 30 days free trial of liferay dxp via 30 day trial footer link.

    Given I click on the footer "30 Day Trial" link under the "Platform" footer category
	And I should be able to view the 30 day trial page and form
	And I request a download of Liferay DXP 30 day free trial with the following values
	| Work Email      | usr.liferaydxp1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Country         | United States                         |  
	| State/Territory | California                            |
	| Download Type   | OSGI Dependencies                     |
	| First Name      | USR                                   |
	| Last Name       | LiferayDXP1                           |
	| Company         | Usrdxp                                |
	| Phone           | 555-555-5678                          |
	And I wait for "3" minutes
    And I should see the downloaded file "liferay-dxp-osgi-7.4.13.u15-20220308132215444.zip"
	And the current url content should contain the text "products/dxp/30-day-trial/thank-you"

Scenario: View all DXP page links
    End users should be able to view all links in the DXP page.
	
    Given I go to the www page with the url "products/dxp"
    And I click on the "Engage more effectively with DXP" link under the "Engage Your Audience Through Enhanced Personalization" section on the DXP Page
    Then there should be no errors on the page
    And the current url content should contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com/products/dxp/engage"
    When I go to the www page with the url "products/dxp"
    And I click on the "Take your support to the next level with DXP" link under the "Support and Empower Users with Self-Service" section on the DXP Page
    Then there should be no errors on the page
    And the current url content should contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com/products/dxp/support"
    When I go to the www page with the url "products/dxp"
    And I click on the "Learn how to grow your business with DXP" link under the "Grow Revenue with a Seamless Commerce Experience" section on the DXP Page
    Then there should be no errors on the page
    And the current url content should contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com/products/dxp/transact"

Scenario: View DXP section video
	End users should be able to view section video in the DXP page.

	Given I go to the www page with the url "products/dxp"
	Then I should be able to watch the section video

Scenario: View DXP top navigation links
	End users should be able to view top navigation links in the DXP page.

	Given I go to the www page with the url "products/dxp"
	And I click on the "What's New" link on the top navigation
    Then there should be no errors on the page
    And the current url content should contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com/products/dxp/new"
    When I go to the www page with the url "products/dxp"
    And I click on the "Engage" link on the top navigation
    Then there should be no errors on the page
    And the current url content should contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com/products/dxp/engage"
    When I go to the www page with the url "products/dxp"
    And I click on the "Support" link on the top navigation
    Then there should be no errors on the page
    And the current url content should contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com/products/dxp/support"
	When I go to the www page with the url "products/dxp"
    And I click on the "Transact" link on the top navigation
    Then there should be no errors on the page
    And the current url content should contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com/products/dxp/transact"